{"belief_id":"blf_fourgram_results_invalid_evidenced","created_at":"2026-07-22T21:10:00-07:00","created_by":"claude-review","evidence_ids":["evd_run_fourgram_gate_bug"],"fingerprint":"0ecb935330e9d007","limitations":["distortion magnitude unquantified"],"next_test":"Re-run 4-gram arms on fixed code before any order claim.","rationale":"Uninitialized parameter under to_empty() is garbage; the gate multiplies the entire 4-gram contribution.","scope":{"model":"nanoGPT rsi/daniel n_layer=8","regime":"single-pass ~0.47 epoch 2000-step H200","scope_key":{"data_split_sha256":"ed8ea0554010df9fbfa47746adc6643d6446797753eb377c0b35413bdcf2fca3","max_steps":2000,"outcome_id":"out_val_bpb","stop_mode":"steps"}},"statement":"RETRACTION (evidenced): all prior 4-gram results are INVALID and the n-gram ORDER axis is UNEXPLORED. fourgram_gate was never initialized in GPT.init_weights, so under meta-construction + model.to_empty() it held uninitialized GPU memory whenever NGRAM_FOURGRAM_MULT>0 -- the 4-gram VE was injected through a random gate. Affects exp_ngram_fourgram_pilot and exp_ngram128_fourgram_discovery (10 runs), which were the sole basis for blf_ngram_order_redundant_with_capacity. Bug fixed (guarded zeros_ init, byte-identical when fourgram is off). Re-measure before any n-gram-order claim.","status":"strongly_supported","subject_ids":["hyp_ngram128_plus_fourgram","mech_ngram_short_context_memory"],"supersedes_belief_id":"blf_fourgram_results_invalid","tags":["bug","fourgram","retraction","invalid"],"version":2}
